## About this package

This package is part of the ${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_MAJOR}.${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_MINOR}.${CPACK_PACKAGE_VERSION_PATCH} release of Emgu LiteRT. It contains:

- `Emgu.LiteRT.LM.Models.dll`: ready-to-use language models (`Emgu.LiteRT.LM.Models` namespace) built on the `Emgu.LiteRT.LM` API. Each model class (currently `Qwen3`, Qwen3-0.6B; `Qwen35_0_8B`, `Qwen35_0_8B_VL` and `Qwen35_4B`, Qwen3.5 0.8B (text, or with images) and 4B; and `Gemma4E2B`/`Gemma4E4B`, Gemma 4 E2B/E4B) downloads its `.litertlm` file on first use and creates the LiteRT-LM engine; `Chat` keeps the message history and sends messages, with optional streaming of the reply. The Gemma 4 models (images and audio) and `Qwen35_0_8B_VL` (images) also accept attachments, sent as `ChatAttachment`s, e.g. `chat.Send("What is in this image?", ChatAttachment.ImageFile("photo.jpg"))`.

```csharp
using (Qwen3 model = new Qwen3())
{
    await model.Init();
    using (Chat chat = model.CreateChat("You are a helpful assistant."))
    {
        ChatReply reply = await chat.SendAsync("What is the capital of France?");
        Console.WriteLine(reply.Text);
    }
}
```

It also has an embedding model, `EmbeddingGemma2` (EmbeddingGemma 2 Text 270M, 165 MB), which turns text into vectors for semantic search: texts with similar meaning get a high cosine similarity.

```csharp
using (EmbeddingGemma2 embedder = new EmbeddingGemma2())
{
    await embedder.Init();
    float[][] documents = embedder.EmbedDocuments(new[] { "Shipping takes three to five days.", "The store opens at 9 am." });
    float[] query = embedder.EmbedQuery("How long does delivery take?");
    float score = EmbeddingModel.CosineSimilarity(query, documents[0]);   // the highest of the two
}
```

`EmbeddingGemma2TextVision` (388 MB) also embeds images, and `EmbeddingGemma2Multimodal` (485 MB) images and audio, in the same space as text - so a text query finds matching photos:

```csharp
using (EmbeddingGemma2TextVision embedder = new EmbeddingGemma2TextVision())
{
    await embedder.Init();
    float[][] photos = embedder.EmbedImages(new[] { File.ReadAllBytes("beach.jpg"), File.ReadAllBytes("forest.jpg") });
    float[] query = embedder.EmbedQuery("people surfing");
    float score = EmbeddingModel.CosineSimilarity(query, photos[0]);   // the higher of the two
}
```

`DocumentIndex` is the search part of asking questions about a document that is too long for the model's context: add its text (and pictures), build the index, and give the model only the passages that match each question:

```csharp
DocumentIndex index = new DocumentIndex();
index.AddText(pageText, "page 1");                 // split into passages
await Task.Run(() => index.Build(embedder));       // embed them
DocumentSearchResult result = index.Search(embedder, question);
string excerpts = string.Join("\n\n", result.Passages.Take(3).Select(m => m.Item.Text));
// ...send the excerpts and the question to a LanguageModel's Chat
```

To use the models with Microsoft.Extensions.AI (`IChatClient`, tool calling) or Microsoft Agent Framework, add the ${EMGU_LITERT_LM_EXTENSIONS_AI_NUGET_ID} package.

