## Note

To deploy to a specific platform, you will also need to add one of the ${EMGU_LITERT_NUGET_ID}.runtime.{platform} nuget packages that include `liblitert-lm` to your executable project: currently ${EMGU_LITERT_NUGET_ID}.runtime.macos (Apple Silicon only) and the MAUI add-on ${EMGU_LITERT_LM_NUGET_ID}.runtime.maui (or directly ${EMGU_LITERT_LM_NUGET_ID}.runtime.maui.android - arm64-v8a and x86_64 - ${EMGU_LITERT_LM_NUGET_ID}.runtime.maui.ios - iOS 26.4 or later, device and simulator - and ${EMGU_LITERT_LM_NUGET_ID}.runtime.maui.macos - Mac Catalyst on Apple Silicon).
<https://www.nuget.org/packages?q=${EMGU_LITERT_NUGET_ID}.runtime>
